%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dde730cde0303e478b528f1fe2b6239, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 542056414265344
    m_Localized: Hi. Hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 542241496317952
    m_Localized: Welcome to The Battle Cats UX!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 542522384662528
    m_Localized: Welcome back my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 543164100591616
    m_Localized: I'm your good companion Cat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 543325409329152
    m_Localized: "And I\u2019m your little game assistant KK!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 543411753271296
    m_Localized: ..........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 543461027954688
    m_Localized: Hey! Who are you?! Showing up out of nowhere?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 543562655940608
    m_Localized: Relax! I'm a traveller from another world, an "Isekai" if you like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544140828164096
    m_Localized: "I find cats rather fascinating, and I\u2019d like to fight alongside
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544298647240704
    m_Localized: Humph! Don't even think about deceiving us cats!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544469988753408
    m_Localized: Look, you're not catified at all! You have none of our marks! How
      can we trust you?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544608027492352
    m_Localized: Oh? Are you talking about her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544686230290432
    m_Localized: Meow meow! I'm Red Crystal Cat! KK is a good person meow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544934264651776
    m_Localized: ..........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 544985389023232
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 545041533976576
    m_Localized: Ah forget it... I'll trust you for now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 545156852170752
    m_Localized: Anyway! Welcome to UX! Team up with the cat army and KK to defeat
      enemies and explore this world!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 545441456668672
    m_Localized: Let's goooo!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658321543168
    m_Localized: Whoa, Wall Cat is here too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874816
    m_Localized: What happened?  Why are there so many doges here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874817
    m_Localized: Who knows what they're up to, come help me drive them away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874818
    m_Localized: I'll go up front, stay close behind me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874819
    m_Localized: "Hey Tank Cat\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874820
    m_Localized: "What's this\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874821
    m_Localized: '"Lickable Cat Treat" you lot were talking about?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874822
    m_Localized: "Oh that\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874823
    m_Localized: Amazing snack we have from time to time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874824
    m_Localized: "One of my personal favourites, almost as good as the legendary
      Cat Food cans\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874825
    m_Localized: No time for chit chat! The Doge army is coming!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874826
    m_Localized: Hyaah! Watch me destroy everything with my trusty axe!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874827
    m_Localized: Stop fooling around! These peon spams are no joke, hurry and come
      help us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874828
    m_Localized: "I can already tell this is gonna be a pain to clear\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874829
    m_Localized: I hope it isn't the same in Cambodia.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874830
    m_Localized: I was planning to visit Angkor Wat afterwards y'know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874831
    m_Localized: Wait, are those Red enemies I'm seeing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874832
    m_Localized: Hey Axe Cat, it's your turn to shine!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874833
    m_Localized: Alright! Leave it to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874834
    m_Localized: ..........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874835
    m_Localized: I've discovered that the treasures found around the world not only
      enhance our cats' combat abilities, but also improve their logistical productivity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874836
    m_Localized: How amazing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874837
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s right. And with the help of some treasure-hunting experts,
      our cats now have a much higher chance of discovering superior treasures!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874838
    m_Localized: Each treasure can increase the health, attack power, production
      rate of our cats, while also boosting our accounting power, base health and
      so on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874839
    m_Localized: "Hmmmm\u2026interesting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874840
    m_Localized: "Looks like I\u2019ve still got quite a lot to learn from you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874841
    m_Localized: Perhaps one day we might go treasure-hunting in my world as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874842
    m_Localized: ..........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874843
    m_Localized: "Treasures\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874844
    m_Localized: In your world?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874845
    m_Localized: Indeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874846
    m_Localized: 48 stages with 3 chapters, much like this one!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874847
    m_Localized: "\u2026..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874848
    m_Localized: "Yeah let's not\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874849
    m_Localized: Alright then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874850
    m_Localized: Wait, you're telling me THIS is a cat?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874851
    m_Localized: Hey! That's mean, I know my legs are gross and all but...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874852
    m_Localized: Not you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874853
    m_Localized: Him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874854
    m_Localized: What kind of cat looks like a cow?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874855
    m_Localized: "As far as I'm concerned, you\u2019re a cat as long as you\u2019ve
      got a cat face."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874856
    m_Localized: "Be careful KK, Cow Cat has a bit of a temper, he loves ramming
      into things when he's mad\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874857
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874858
    m_Localized: "\xA1Vamos, toro! (Waves cape)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874859
    m_Localized: "\u2026..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874860
    m_Localized: You know I'm not a bull right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874861
    m_Localized: "\u2026??.?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874862
    m_Localized: Screw this I'm ramming into you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874863
    m_Localized: I thought you said you weren't a bul-
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874864
    m_Localized: "\u2026..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874865
    m_Localized: "You\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874866
    m_Localized: Whatever, I don't care anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874867
    m_Localized: Rawr Rawr.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874868
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve always wanted to ask you lot something."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874869
    m_Localized: Why do you categorise enemies by traits when discussing strategy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874870
    m_Localized: "Can\u2019t you simply find a common weakness that works for all
      of them?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874871
    m_Localized: What are you talking about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874872
    m_Localized: "Red enemies? Their weakness is that they\u2019re red."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874873
    m_Localized: Same logic goes for black enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874874
    m_Localized: Funny enough, most cats are actually traitless no matter how they
      look, though not many enemies have noticed this yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874875
    m_Localized: "So what you\u2019re saying is\u2026all of you cats share a common
      weakness that works on the lot of you\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874876
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874877
    m_Localized: That's not my point!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874878
    m_Localized: "Red enemies? Their weakness \u2014 being red!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874879
    m_Localized: "Black enemies? Their weakness \u2014 being bl-"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874880
    m_Localized: Alright alright, I get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874881
    m_Localized: Let's stop before this gets weird, shall we.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874882
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve got to figure out how \u201Cbeing red\u201D counts as
      a weakness."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874883
    m_Localized: Good luck with that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874884
    m_Localized: Oh at last, we finally have a ranged attacker in our team, lovely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874885
    m_Localized: "\u2026!!!!..!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874886
    m_Localized: Hey! That's very rude of you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874887
    m_Localized: I'm a ranged unit too you know!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874888
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874889
    m_Localized: I can hit enemies with the horns on my head!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874890
    m_Localized: Surely that reaches farther than you biting things with your mouth!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874891
    m_Localized: "\u2026..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874892
    m_Localized: "\u2026..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874893
    m_Localized: He's just like that sometimes. You'll get used to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874894
    m_Localized: But it's true. You shouldn't underestimate his value!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874895
    m_Localized: "I\u2019ve heard that through sheer hard work, Cow Cat managed to
      develop a small chance to crit all by himself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874896
    m_Localized: Let's hope that comes in handy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874897
    m_Localized: "Hey guys, is it just me\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874898
    m_Localized: "Or is there a glitch in one frame of my sprite\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874899
    m_Localized: Though it somehow doesn't affect me at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874900
    m_Localized: Can you guys see it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874901
    m_Localized: So weird.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874902
    m_Localized: Oh right, I wonder why.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874903
    m_Localized: Just a personal guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874904
    m_Localized: "But perhaps it\u2019s simply a bug that Kizumiii was far too lazy
      to fix."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874905
    m_Localized: '?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874906
    m_Localized: Who?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874907
    m_Localized: "Well, let's just say I can see something you lot can\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658371874908
    m_Localized: But Titan Cat, are you sure you're alright?  How about you go home
      and rest for now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457728
    m_Localized: "I feel perfectly normal though\u2026oh well, let's just see as
      we go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457729
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t push yourself too hard. We still have plenty of adventures
      ahead of us!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457730
    m_Localized: "Hey, everyone, have a look at this. I\u2019m anti-red now as well!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457731
    m_Localized: No way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457732
    m_Localized: "Haha, safe to say I\u2019m quite the quick learner."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457733
    m_Localized: Though unlike the rest of you, I can't be summoned with money. I
      simply show up whenever you need me, hope that's of some use, haha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457734
    m_Localized: That's great, let's keep going for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457735
    m_Localized: <size=64>I'm Jerry Kuo!</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457736
    m_Localized: "\u2026??\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457737
    m_Localized: "Right\u2026 pretend I didn\u2019t say anything."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457738
    m_Localized: Hey, did you notice the item you just got?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457739
    m_Localized: That is a Level+ and Level Certificate, with that you can upgrade
      basic cats to level 15!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457740
    m_Localized: If you collect more of these, you can eventually increase our level
      cap to 50+50. That way, everyone gets a shot at reaching level 100!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457741
    m_Localized: Please don't give up, the future of the Cat Army is in your hands!
      We can do this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457742
    m_Localized: "\u2026.."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457743
    m_Localized: "\u2026......."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457744
    m_Localized: "\u2026................."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457745
    m_Localized: "Yeah\u2026all in your hands\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457746
    m_Localized: "I wonder what the future holds for the Cat Army\u2026heh\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457747
    m_Localized: You actually made it all the way to the Moon. Quite impressive,
      really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457748
    m_Localized: 'Of course, with the return of the Doge Army, we''ll have to see
      what''s going on with their leader. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457749
    m_Localized: "Speaking of that, isn\u2019t it strange how the enemies seem way
      more aggressive than before?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457750
    m_Localized: Especially here on the Moon, the manic energy just keeps getting
      stronger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457751
    m_Localized: "Perhaps the Moon holds the answers you\u2019ve been looking for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457752
    m_Localized: I've learnt quite a lot travelling and fighting with you across
      the globe. Your world is truly fascinating, it almost makes me want to stay
      a little longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457753
    m_Localized: But don't expect much more help from me. I much prefer watching
      from the side and seeing how your story unfolds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457754
    m_Localized: You really are a strange one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457755
    m_Localized: Alright then, let's get moving, we need to figure out what's behind
      all this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17035658384457756
    m_Localized: We've taken over the moon once, and we're not afraid to do it again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750217969713152
    m_Localized: "Damn it\u2026even back on Earth the Doge Army still won\u2019t
      settle down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822016
    m_Localized: Well, what can you do. They're stubborn as ever, they only quiet
      down once you beat them properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822017
    m_Localized: And their aggression is nothing like before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822018
    m_Localized: "I haven't felt quite right ever since we came back from the Moon.
      Something's off\u2014we need to look into this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822019
    m_Localized: Have you cats ever heard of tidal forces? If the distance between
      the Earth and the Moon shifts even a little, it can affect most living creatures.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822020
    m_Localized: Plagiarism? Who copied what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822021
    m_Localized: "\u2026Nevermind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822022
    m_Localized: But if that's the case, then someone must've tampered with something
      on the Moon, yes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822023
    m_Localized: Maybe, we need to dig deeper into this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822024
    m_Localized: Off you go then cats, I have faith in you all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822025
    m_Localized: "By the way\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822026
    m_Localized: Have you noticed this button right next to the unit deployment commands?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822027
    m_Localized: "It seems to influence how some cats behave\u2026 Switch it to attack
      and they'll charge straight in, but set it to defence and they'll instantly
      pull back instead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822028
    m_Localized: Some of them do seem a fair bit smarter than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822029
    m_Localized: Like Bird Cat, who used to dive straight onto enemy forces, completely
      forgetting how fragile its body is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822030
    m_Localized: "Quite something to think about\u2026The cats are getting a touch
      more strategic, a touch more complex."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822031
    m_Localized: "But the final call's in your hands, and you\u2019re hardly ordinary
      yourself, are you\u2026 heh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822032
    m_Localized: "Better put it to good use, that just gives me more to jot down
      in my notes\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822035
    m_Localized: "What? Doge Darks? They shouldn't be here\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822036
    m_Localized: "I'm really starting to lose my grasp on what's going on\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822037
    m_Localized: Remember what KK said before? That something might be going on up
      on the Moon? We need to look into it properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822038
    m_Localized: "Strange, so so strange\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822039
    m_Localized: "Why am I the only one who loses my cat face after I evolve\u2026?
      Please trust me, I grew up with all of you\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822040
    m_Localized: We believe you Titan Cat, from your glitched sprite to your face
      catching fire after evolving, something's definitely not right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822041
    m_Localized: "My legs\u2026why are they so muscular\u2026no\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822042
    m_Localized: But you got stronger too, didn't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822043
    m_Localized: Calm down. What we need to do now is find the source of all this.
      We can't let anyone keep suffering like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822044
    m_Localized: "What we need most right now is teamwork, for us and for Earth\u2018s
      future."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822045
    m_Localized: Got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822046
    m_Localized: Hey, who's that strangely looking doge?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822047
    m_Localized: "It's so strange\u2026 as fragile as the others, but weirdly tough\u2014almost
      like it has three lives\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822048
    m_Localized: And it's clearly not from Earth. We've never seen anything like
      it. I'm worried it's going to cause trouble later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822049
    m_Localized: "Damn it\u2026there's so much to deal with right now\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822050
    m_Localized: Be careful of the Metal Enemies! They seem stronger than ever before!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822051
    m_Localized: Seems you lot are having a bit of a tough time here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822052
    m_Localized: "Enemies constantly appearing wave after wave\u2026thankfully most
      of them seem to be in red, perfectly suited for your team."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218036822053
    m_Localized: "And I pray it stays that way\u2026I won't be able to handle any
      more new enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016320
    m_Localized: "They bite so hard as well! Jeez, and to think I'm suppose to be
      specialised against them\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016321
    m_Localized: At least we still have enough catpower to deal with them for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016322
    m_Localized: "Damn it\u2026what is happening here\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016323
    m_Localized: "\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016324
    m_Localized: These doges can even control their damage taken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016325
    m_Localized: This is getting funny.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016326
    m_Localized: I might discover more creatures following them, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016327
    m_Localized: What, I've been helping all the way since the beginning!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016328
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016329
    m_Localized: "Sometimes, to reach your goals, you\u2019ve simply got to be patient."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016330
    m_Localized: Patience is of the utmost importance, after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016331
    m_Localized: Hey hey hey, wake up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016332
    m_Localized: "You alright? You looked like you were having a pretty bad nightmare\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016333
    m_Localized: "What? A black bear suddenly appeared and nearly wiped us all out? 
      Sounds like you\u2019re really stressed\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016334
    m_Localized: "Hey, relax\u2014there aren't any black bears around here. We're
      all fine, right? Once you're feeling better, we can head out."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016335
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t worry, there\u2019s no such thing as a black bear. If
      there were, we\u2019d have run into one already, right? Just catch up with
      us once you're feeling better."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016336
    m_Localized: W-why Nyandam here?! I thought he's suppose to be on the moon..!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016337
    m_Localized: "He even brought his peons here too\u2026what happened up there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016338
    m_Localized: "This is all getting weirder and weirder\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17750218041016339
    m_Localized: Well, at least Valkrye Cat is here to aid us as well , let's go
      boys, we can win this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703307931648
    m_Localized: Finally, we are here at moon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040512
    m_Localized: I can feel the strange aura around just like the strange doge and
      hippoe. We should be more careful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040513
    m_Localized: It's time to expose the true faces of these monsters and see what
      they're really up to behind the scenes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040514
    m_Localized: Be careful the human like enemy. He is hitting us so much!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040515
    m_Localized: His attacks are really painful and will hold back our offensive.
      Every time we exert force, the wound will tear open...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040516
    m_Localized: I...am...suffering from this......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040517
    m_Localized: "Cow Cat! You okay?! Damn it\u2014he's too worked up and losing
      a lot of blood. Get him to Moneko to recover! We'll handle things here!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040518
    m_Localized: This is really troublesome...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040519
    m_Localized: "But honestly, the damage isn't that high. I'll hold the front\u2014back
      line, pump out more DPS! This pain doesn't slow me down much!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040520
    m_Localized: Watch out! They are coming right now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040521
    m_Localized: Hold on! I can see some strange buildings ahead. We must find their
      location!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040522
    m_Localized: We are at this strange structure!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040523
    m_Localized: This one is like a ruined lab. Be careful, boys, Gettt.. Reaa..dy......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040524
    m_Localized: Wee...... e Go..... Fin....d .. ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040525
    m_Localized: ...........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703375040526
    m_Localized: ...........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623424
    m_Localized: ......Do not, trust, anyone, here...... They, not, belong to, the
      cat world......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623425
    m_Localized: ...Please, remember this...... If you find you did sth wrong....
      Do not, look back....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623426
    m_Localized: ......Who, am, I..? ..You, will, know, when time, comes....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623427
    m_Localized: "Stay conscious\u2026 stay rational\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623428
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623429
    m_Localized: Hey, wake up! You just passed out right here..!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623430
    m_Localized: Oh, I see. Maybe it's because of the moon environment. You might
      not be used to it yet. I'm sorry I didn't take that into account. Go find Moneko
      and have a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17982703387623431
    m_Localized: You said there will be powerful enemies? Yes, yes. We'll be careful!
      Trust our cat army. We're about to go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726306963456
    m_Localized: "So\u2026 this is the beautiful home you kept talking about\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015360
    m_Localized: Looks even worse than I imagined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015361
    m_Localized: "What\u2026 happened here?! We only went to the Moon\u2014how did
      Earth change this much?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015362
    m_Localized: You're finally back! While you were gone, the monsters on Earth
      launched another full-scale assault!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015363
    m_Localized: We can't hold the line! We need backup!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015364
    m_Localized: "Hey, newbie\u2014join the Cat Army! Every cat's fate is in all
      of our hands!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015365
    m_Localized: "Who're you calling a newbie?! Rude much\u2026 I'm Reisen. Reisen
      from Gensokyo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015366
    m_Localized: "One day I woke up lost in a purple-red mist, too weak to move.
      Several strange robots grabbed me\u2014I couldn't fight back at all\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015367
    m_Localized: "Ugh, my memories are a mess\u2026 When I came to, you'd already
      brought me back to Earth."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015368
    m_Localized: "You really don't seem like those weird invaders. We believe you\u2014please
      join the Cat Army and fight beside us. Maybe you'll recover pieces of who you
      were along the way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015369
    m_Localized: It's an incident, Reimu. A real incident.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015370
    m_Localized: "Huh\u2026? Who are you? How do you know about Gensokyo?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015371
    m_Localized: "Well, thanks for rescuing me all the same. But where I'm from,
      if you want to convince me, we settle it with a spell card duel first\u2014so
      here I come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015372
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015373
    m_Localized: Hey, calm down!! We're not ready yet!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015374
    m_Localized: Hyah! Hah! Take this!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015375
    m_Localized: "That's not fair! This many cats against one\u2026?! Fine, I lose,
      I lose!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015376
    m_Localized: "Ahem\u2026 I hate to admit it, but you cats pack a punch. I underestimated
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015377
    m_Localized: We're both trying to resolve the same incident, so let's cooperate
      for now. Nice to work with you, cats!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015378
    m_Localized: "Nice\u2014another ally on the team."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015379
    m_Localized: You just got here and you barely know what's going on. Can you actually
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015380
    m_Localized: "Don't underestimate me. I'm good at spotting enemy weak points\u2014I
      can inflict long-lasting debuffs."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015381
    m_Localized: "We'll see who staged this whole mess and trapped me here\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015382
    m_Localized: "Look closely\u2014is that\u2026 Moneko\u2026? What's she doing
      over there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015383
    m_Localized: "She looks like she's chatting with the Doges. Weird\u2014can Moneko
      tame and turn enemies too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015384
    m_Localized: "Wait wait wait!! That's not me\u2014I'm right here! That one's
      an imposter!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015385
    m_Localized: "Wha\u2026 what?! Two Monekos?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015386
    m_Localized: "Up close, that Moneko's face looks\u2026 off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015387
    m_Localized: "Don't tell me\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015388
    m_Localized: "Sniffle\u2026 I can't take this\u2026 how could this happen\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015389
    m_Localized: "Moneko, we get it\u2014the Doge side stole your ability, and it
      hurts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015390
    m_Localized: "It's okay. Moneko's always been our rock. The cats believe in you\u2014always!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015391
    m_Localized: "That\u2026 that Doge\u2026 how dare it\u2026 copy me and make it\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015392
    m_Localized: <size=100>THIS UGLY?!</size>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015393
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015394
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015395
    m_Localized: Maybe we worried too much?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015396
    m_Localized: "Oh my gosh, what was that place just now\u2026?! My head's spinning!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015397
    m_Localized: "Hold on\u2026 I've seen scenery like this somewhere before\u2026
      what was it\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015398
    m_Localized: "What was it\u2026 ugh, my head hurts too\u2014I can't remember\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015399
    m_Localized: "I've got a bad feeling something nasty is about to show up\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015400
    m_Localized: "Detecting\u2026 hostile incursion\u2026 target confirmed\u2026
      Cats\u2026 initiating\u2026 attack\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015401
    m_Localized: For crying out loud, keep your jinxes to yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36232726416015402
    m_Localized: Also, who's the real invader here?! Blow up already, you piece of
      scrap!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574009163776
    m_Localized: What was THAT just now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604288
    m_Localized: "That's Teacher Bun Bun\u2014an old friend\u2026 and a royal pain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604289
    m_Localized: "Word is, punishing kids means sitting through his \u201Cloving
      lectures.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604290
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604291
    m_Localized: "Don't try to understand it\u2014just feel it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604292
    m_Localized: "\u2026And this conversation is taking a weird turn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604293
    m_Localized: "Feels like the enemies are finally learning some tricks\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604294
    m_Localized: "They hit and fall back\u2014total pests to pin down."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604295
    m_Localized: Huh. That's actually useful intel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604296
    m_Localized: "Maybe our cats should bust out real tactics against pests like
      this\u2014I bet it'll pay off big!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604297
    m_Localized: "Teacher Bun Bun's running on fumes\u2014rush him and land the finisher!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604298
    m_Localized: "\u2026You sure about that? Look closer\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604299
    m_Localized: "He went full dark mode\u2014and dragged his kid into it!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604300
    m_Localized: "He cracked that fast\u2014what happens when our multipliers scale
      up?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604301
    m_Localized: "Relax\u2014just means he soaks hits a bit better now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604302
    m_Localized: Everyone forward! Let's school THIS teacher!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604303
    m_Localized: "I just woke up\u2014why are these random freaks in my face?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604304
    m_Localized: "That seahorse is on FIRE on dry land\u2014science wants a word
      with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604305
    m_Localized: "You're talking about\u2026 science\u2026 in THIS world? That's
      a niche hobby."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604306
    m_Localized: "Also\u2014who are these two strangers in the Cat Army?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604307
    m_Localized: "I'm KK\u2014a traveller from another world, here to observe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604308
    m_Localized: "This is our tactician\u2014he's the real deal. They've got our
      cat marks; we're all friends."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604309
    m_Localized: "Nice. Call me Baha\u2014pleasure to meet you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604310
    m_Localized: "World's gone nuts\u2014Baha, time to flex those divine muscles!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604311
    m_Localized: "Every monster shall face justice\u2014crushed under Baha's Dark
      Light Wave!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604312
    m_Localized: "\u201CDark Light Wave\u201D? It's basically a dark-matter energy
      orb."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604313
    m_Localized: "\u2026Just a teensy, totally reasonable amount of damage. Pinky
      promise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604314
    m_Localized: "Right\u2014you've earned the cats' trust, so I'll follow your lead.
      Orders?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604315
    m_Localized: "What in the\u2014what IS that thing in the sky\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604316
    m_Localized: "Careful\u2014that machine loves jump scares."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604317
    m_Localized: "Spooky as heck, but it can't seem to hit me\u2014back line, watch
      yourselves!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604318
    m_Localized: "From what I've observed\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604319
    m_Localized: "It's super unstable\u2014falls apart if you breathe on it wrong."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604320
    m_Localized: Solid knock and it crashes. We need a real plan.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604321
    m_Localized: MAN!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604322
    m_Localized: "\u2026??"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604323
    m_Localized: "I hope they're REALLY that fragile\u2014saves me a ton of hassle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604324
    m_Localized: "Aaaah\u2014rats!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604325
    m_Localized: "Bro\u2014we're CATS. Why are you scared of mice?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604326
    m_Localized: Look over there yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604327
    m_Localized: "Aaaah\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604328
    m_Localized: "I was napping underground\u2014why's everything exploding?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604329
    m_Localized: "Bet it's you stinky cats and your endless war\u2014without you
      I'd be living the dream!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604330
    m_Localized: "You want a fight on my doorstep? Fine\u2014take a hike, all of
      you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604331
    m_Localized: "Nice try, smelly rat\u2014look around before you blame the Cat
      Army!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604332
    m_Localized: Aliens are invading and you're still asleep?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604333
    m_Localized: "Alien invasion? Ancient gossip\u2014and YOU're getting schooled
      today!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604334
    m_Localized: So much for small talk. Lock and load, kids.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604335
    m_Localized: "Aaaah\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604336
    m_Localized: "Whoa\u2026 those pecs\u2026 biceps\u2026 triceps\u2026 oh\u2014abs
      too\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604337
    m_Localized: "Ah\u2026 skipped leg day though. Sorry Mr. Rat\u2014you're not
      my type\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604338
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026??????"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604339
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604340
    m_Localized: "None of your business\u2014scram, stinky cats!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604341
    m_Localized: "*cough* So\u2026 some lunar crisis mutated everything into hyper-aggressive
      freaks\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604342
    m_Localized: You ONLY listen after a beatdown, huh?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604343
    m_Localized: "Yeah\u2014we're clueless too, but we're cleaning it up best we
      can."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604344
    m_Localized: "Alright\u2026 I get the picture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604345
    m_Localized: "True\u2014I've been weirdly fired up lately, gains went turbo\u2026
      ended up like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604346
    m_Localized: "I know how the street works\u2014my bad for blaming you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604347
    m_Localized: "So\u2026 you gonna apologize with something tasty to prove it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604348
    m_Localized: "Weeeell\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604349
    m_Localized: "I stash human wafer cookies\u2014they turbo my gains. I'll share
      some\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604350
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2014my gopher pal went nuts stealing snacks and dug off with
      my stash."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604351
    m_Localized: "He even sneaked to South America\u2026 used to hide\u2014now he's
      cocky. Probably the incident too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604352
    m_Localized: "Rough him up for me and the wafers are yours\u2014huge help!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604353
    m_Localized: "\u2026What kind of \u201Ccode\u201D is this\u2014you mess up and
      WE do the chores?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604354
    m_Localized: "Fine\u2014we get snacks. I'll let it slide."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604355
    m_Localized: "Muscle Rat\u2014you're helping fix this too. Keep spectating and
      even your shorts get yoinked."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604356
    m_Localized: Cheat much? How's that gopher tunneling ACROSS THE OCEAN?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604357
    m_Localized: "Muscle Rat\u2014was your buddy always this cracked?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604358
    m_Localized: "\u2026Probably mutated too, I'd say\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604359
    m_Localized: Guess my muscle spike was small potatoes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604360
    m_Localized: "Weird storms on this island\u2014stay sharp, everyone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604361
    m_Localized: "What even\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604362
    m_Localized: Where'd they drop us?! We visit South America and now it's bullet
      hail?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604363
    m_Localized: American quick-draw duels HERE too?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604364
    m_Localized: "You're right\u2014they don't belong on this planet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604365
    m_Localized: "Spears, chains, quick-draw\u2026 we're in for serious brawls ahead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604366
    m_Localized: "Oh snap\u2014isn't this from that mobile game\u2026 Girls' Front\u2026
      something\u2026 I've seen this\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604367
    m_Localized: "\u2026?? What did you just say\u2014he's a\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604368
    m_Localized: "Ignore her\u2014random nonsense! Guns? Try tanking MY barbarian
      charge!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604369
    m_Localized: "Don't pile more stress on Moneko\u2014the support line's already
      fried."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604370
    m_Localized: "Oh\u2026 if Mixin Rat trained legs more\u2026 maybe\u2026 I'd consider
      it\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604371
    m_Localized: Bro GET LOST!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604372
    m_Localized: This is the rocket launch pad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604373
    m_Localized: "Moon expedition\u2014take two."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604374
    m_Localized: "This time we find REAL answers\u2014no early bailout."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604375
    m_Localized: "We found a lab on the far side\u2014who knows what lurks on the
      dark face\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604376
    m_Localized: "Hawaiian crater zone\u2014life here shrugs off volcanic ash like
      it's nothing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604377
    m_Localized: Including those rabid monsters, naturally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604378
    m_Localized: "Whatever\u2014same faces, same Ls for the Doge Army!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604379
    m_Localized: "Definitely scripted\u2014that gopher tunneled to THE MOON?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604380
    m_Localized: Bet its mutation is teleporting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604381
    m_Localized: "Peak sci-fi\u2014what's the endgame?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604382
    m_Localized: "Rats below, flying scrap above\u2014everyone's lost it!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604383
    m_Localized: "Don't laugh\u2014stage two incoming. Prep now or YOU'RE the pancake."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604384
    m_Localized: "Please\u2014no more clown-car enemy piles\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604385
    m_Localized: "L-look\u2014someone's over there! What's she doing?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604386
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604387
    m_Localized: "Urgh\u2026 what\u2026 are you\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604388
    m_Localized: "Stay back\u2026 I'll\u2026 kill you\u2026 kill\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604389
    m_Localized: "Don't get close\u2014she's dangerous\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604390
    m_Localized: Who are you?! Why on the Moon?! What IS this ruined lab?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604391
    m_Localized: "Urgh\u2026 my head\u2026 it hurts\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604392
    m_Localized: "Traitors\u2026 all of you\u2026 I won't tell\u2026 aah\u2026 come
      closer and you're\u2026 toast\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604393
    m_Localized: "We're not villains\u2014we're natives! YOU'RE the invader\u2014what
      do you WANT?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604394
    m_Localized: "Hmph\u2026 I warned you\u2026 step closer\u2026 you're done\u2026
      *panting*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604395
    m_Localized: "Crap\u2014we ticked her off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604396
    m_Localized: "Her scrap bots are coming\u2014watch out\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604397
    m_Localized: "Damn it\u2014we need her caught! She knows the truth!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604398
    m_Localized: "She bolted\u2014wipe these jerks first, don't lose sight of her!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604399
    m_Localized: "Look\u2014this must be her nest! Giant unfamiliar tower rig!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604400
    m_Localized: Why are Earth mobs spawning HERE?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604401
    m_Localized: "Not just the gopher\u2014feels like anything can get warped in
      our faces!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604402
    m_Localized: "Heh\u2026 useless\u2026 you're all traitors\u2026 unworthy\u2026
      of coming near\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604403
    m_Localized: This is your base, isn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604404
    m_Localized: "Surrender\u2014you're boxed in! Play nice and we might go easy!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604405
    m_Localized: "Surrender\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574126604406
    m_Localized: "Heh\u2026 traitors\u2026 never\u2026 surrender\u2026!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575808
    m_Localized: "You still have\u2026 MY power\u2026 GIVE IT\u2026 GIVE IT BACK\u2026!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575809
    m_Localized: "What\u2014stop talking crazy! We're warning you\u2014you've already\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575810
    m_Localized: "AAAH!! M-my head\u2026!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575811
    m_Localized: Reisen?! What's wrong?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575812
    m_Localized: "N-no\u2026 my head\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575813
    m_Localized: "Everyone\u2026 get away\u2026 RUN\u2026!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575814
    m_Localized: GET OUT OF HERE!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575815
    m_Localized: "Heh\u2026 I told you\u2026 traitors!! YOU are!! Hahaha\u2026 revenge\u2026
      hahaha\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575816
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575817
    m_Localized: "Hey\u2026 we're going too, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575818
    m_Localized: "Even if it changes the whole world\u2026 you in?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575819
    m_Localized: "You'll stand with the cats\u2026 won't you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575820
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575821
    m_Localized: "\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575822
    m_Localized: Stop stop stoooop!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575823
    m_Localized: "FREEZE\u2026!!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575824
    m_Localized: "Serious question\u2014WHY are you beating me up?! What did I DO?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575825
    m_Localized: "Uhh\u2026 'cause they said thrashing you drops Cat XP."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575826
    m_Localized: "We didn't know the protocol, so we\u2026 openly asked\u2014with
      punches. That work?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575827
    m_Localized: "You call a brawl \u201Casking nicely?!\u201D EXCUSE ME?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575828
    m_Localized: "Ow my poor smithing back\u2014you're bullying an elder! Karma's
      coming\u2014boohoo!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575829
    m_Localized: "Elder? You look younger than those PC Academy girls\u2014middle
      school vibes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575830
    m_Localized: "Aw, thanks\u2014that actually cheered me up."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575831
    m_Localized: "Yeah, beating me does drop XP\u2014no idea why. Cats've been leeching
      off me forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575832
    m_Localized: "I'm a gear smith\u2014forging eats XP too. I've got output AND
      overhead."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575833
    m_Localized: "I've got XP to spare\u2014not scared of you\u2026 but does it HAVE
      to be violence\u2026?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575834
    m_Localized: "Fine\u2014call it cardio. Want XP? Come find me~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575835
    m_Localized: "Yay\u2014thanks, XP-oneesan!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70664574147575836
    m_Localized: "Literal broken-tier concept character\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343246061568
    m_Localized: ......... (Click.) .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781824
    m_Localized: ......... (Click, click.) ......... (Click.) .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781825
    m_Localized: Hey, I mean... this flowerbed's been a total mess lately. No matter
      how much we clean, it won't stay tidy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781826
    m_Localized: Senpai, you aren't messing things up while I'm cleaning, are you...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781827
    m_Localized: I totally get the feeling you're the type who'd do something like
      that...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781828
    m_Localized: Don't make excuses for your own laziness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781829
    m_Localized: Why would I wreck our flowerbed for no reason?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781830
    m_Localized: Besides, this is public property. What's in it for us if we trash
      it? I wanna clock out too, y'know...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781831
    m_Localized: Fine... but it's seriously messy here. Senpai, did you notice anything
      weird?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781832
    m_Localized: I have been thinking...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781833
    m_Localized: You go tidy up first. I'll look into this later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781834
    m_Localized: Alright, but please hurry, Senpai. I'm dead tired...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781835
    m_Localized: Yeah, yeah, yeah... just get going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781836
    m_Localized: Kahlani, stop fussing with the plants... look at this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781837
    m_Localized: Hm...? What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781838
    m_Localized: "See these flowers? They were crushed by something heavy. And look
      at these scratches in the dirt\u2014whatever did this was pretty bulky."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781839
    m_Localized: I thought we'd find tracks easily, but everything around here is
      trashed. Even the soil outside is torn up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781840
    m_Localized: Makes sense... so it's not just one person, or maybe something really
      big came through here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781841
    m_Localized: But who'd even come here? We're in the middle of nowhere on the
      border. I'm almost used to it being just the two of us...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781842
    m_Localized: Hey, Kahlani.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781843
    m_Localized: What is it, Senpai?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781844
    m_Localized: Stop working. How about we properly investigate this...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781845
    m_Localized: Huh? B-but... it's such a mess... Minami's gonna be mad, and our
      paycheck at the end of the month...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781846
    m_Localized: Oh come on, why do you still care what she thinks? Don't you trust
      your big sis Sally?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781847
    m_Localized: Who's your boss?! It's me! Come here, let me get a look at you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781848
    m_Localized: Aah...! No...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781849
    m_Localized: .
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781850
    m_Localized: Senpai! The garden we cleaned up yesterday is wrecked again today?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781851
    m_Localized: No way, my wages...! If I get fired, I'll lose my new-graduate benefits...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781852
    m_Localized: Hmph. Messing around on Sally's turf? Whoever they are, they've
      got guts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781853
    m_Localized: Kahlani, come here. Let's give 'em a little surprise...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781854
    m_Localized: Oh? Is this... Little Lamp-chan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781855
    m_Localized: We'll have them stand guard here at night, and we'll know who came
      by! My paycheck is riding on you guys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781856
    m_Localized: Hehe... just sending Lamp-chan won't be enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781857
    m_Localized: Kahlani, you know what to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781858
    m_Localized: ?!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781859
    m_Localized: What do you mean... no one...? The lamp broke at night?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781860
    m_Localized: Senpai, are we being haunted...?! Are we cursed?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781861
    m_Localized: Hahaha, really? If there's a ghost, bring it out. I wanna see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781862
    m_Localized: Looks like these guys know a little magic. Cheap tricks like that
      won't do us in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781863
    m_Localized: Are you here just to be a pain? What's the point of trampling our
      field? If you've got guts, come out and face me one on one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781864
    m_Localized: Senpai, they don't seem friendly. How about I stand watch tonight...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781865
    m_Localized: No no no, I wanna see what else they've got up their sleeves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781866
    m_Localized: You've got some nerve messing with Sally on her own turf. Come out
      and confess, and I might let you live.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781867
    m_Localized: (Ugh... Senpai... you'd better not beg for mercy like last time...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781868
    m_Localized: Senpai... you don't think it's... that thing... the legend that
      comes every 700 years...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781869
    m_Localized: Oh...? You know about that too...? I thought everyone had forgotten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781870
    m_Localized: It's been over six hundred years, hasn't it? If it's true, our world's
      in for some massive changes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781871
    m_Localized: "But so what? I think it'd be kinda fun\u2014spice up our lives.
      And do you really believe in that stuff?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781872
    m_Localized: Well... what if it is...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781873
    m_Localized: You've got no experience. If this could affect us, we'd already
      be done for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781874
    m_Localized: It's fine. Our border inspector is way stronger than us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781875
    m_Localized: You mean... Zela? I haven't seen her in ages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781876
    m_Localized: Yeah, anyone who becomes a border inspector here isn't exactly...
      normal human material! You should see what kind of brainwashing they go through.
      Ugh! Barely even human anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781877
    m_Localized: I'm telling you, if we get bandits while tending flowers, we might
      as well quit. Working hard for nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781878
    m_Localized: Um, Senpai... I think I do more work than you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781879
    m_Localized: What're you muttering? Say it to your big sis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781880
    m_Localized: '!!!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77152343304781881
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583000199168
    m_Localized: Hmm, looks like things have improved back home after our lunar adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502336
    m_Localized: But the truth remains hidden. We still don't know why the world
      ended up like this. We'll need to venture even further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502337
    m_Localized: Hmph, you cats aren't half bad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502338
    m_Localized: "Well, I've helped enough. Time to head home and sort things out.
      Too much chaos lately. We're even\u2014let's part ways here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502339
    m_Localized: Wait!!! Mr. Mouse!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502340
    m_Localized: ??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502341
    m_Localized: I think if you stayed, we could build an even better army...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502342
    m_Localized: "I agree! This rat bro's got strength\u2014he can match our Titan
      Cat. And he's righteous too, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502343
    m_Localized: ......Is this really okay? As a mouse, can I truly fit in with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502344
    m_Localized: "No problem! Look at these humans\u2014they get along with us just
      fine."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502345
    m_Localized: Huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502346
    m_Localized: "......Well, if you insist... I've been training these muscles forever\u2014time
      to put them to use."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502347
    m_Localized: Alright! I'll go tell my brothers, then come back to spar with you.
      Show me what you've really got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502348
    m_Localized: Heh, you'd better be ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502349
    m_Localized: Hehe... *slurp slurp*... It worked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77843583071502350
    m_Localized: ???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449703419904
    m_Localized: You're beaten! Nowhere to run! Give up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111680
    m_Localized: Hahaha... heh... do you really... think so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111681
    m_Localized: Heh... you're all finished... Earth... hehe...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111682
    m_Localized: She's lost it. Let's bring her back for interrogation. Wasting time
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111683
    m_Localized: Hahaha... come again! Come again! You... can't... defeat me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111684
    m_Localized: AAAAAAH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111685
    m_Localized: "What the\u2014?! What IS this?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111686
    m_Localized: So scary... looks like I can't help!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111687
    m_Localized: Something big's coming! Everyone fall back! Ready for round two!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111688
    m_Localized: ??!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111689
    m_Localized: This ends now... take this...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111690
    m_Localized: ......Guh...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111691
    m_Localized: Impossible... I... can't... die here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111692
    m_Localized: Aaah... my head...!!! It hurts... it hurts...!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111693
    m_Localized: Titan Cat! Danger! Get away!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111694
    m_Localized: Aah... the core... is... you... can't... win...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111695
    m_Localized: No... my vision... fading...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111696
    m_Localized: Unforgivable... what ARE you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111697
    m_Localized: Hey! Listen to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111698
    m_Localized: '!!! ...??'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111699
    m_Localized: We don't know who you are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111700
    m_Localized: But... we mean no harm! We're the ones defending our home!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111701
    m_Localized: Our cat companions live on this land! We never wanted to fight you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111702
    m_Localized: Wall Cat, watch out! Don't go near her!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111703
    m_Localized: "We're the native cats of this planet! We welcome new friends\u2014you
      must have misunderstood!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111704
    m_Localized: As a traveller, I know these cats best! They're all kind and friendly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111705
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111706
    m_Localized: You call us invaders. But you must have something you protect too,
      right?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111707
    m_Localized: ......My... protected... thing...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111708
    m_Localized: My land... my family... for them... forever... fighting...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111709
    m_Localized: ...Can't... stop... me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111710
    m_Localized: You idiot! You don't understand the situation at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111711
    m_Localized: Hey, Lion Cat! Calm down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111712
    m_Localized: This is a desolate moon! What family or friends? What have you even
      protected?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111713
    m_Localized: YOU'RE the invader! You wrecked our world! Don't you get it?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111714
    m_Localized: Hey, calm down! You'll set her off again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111715
    m_Localized: Hey! Listen! We believe in what you want to protect!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111716
    m_Localized: But! No matter what you protect, don't forget your original heart!
      Find yourself again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111717
    m_Localized: Think hard! Who are you! What you want to protect...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111718
    m_Localized: ...I am... what I protect...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111719
    m_Localized: ......!!! ...Right, Phi... Phyllis... find her...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111720
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111721
    m_Localized: Natives... you're... cats...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111722
    m_Localized: Uaaah! No, you...!! Save me... aaah...!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111723
    m_Localized: Danger! Don't get closer!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111724
    m_Localized: Wait... that purple glow on her chest is...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111725
    m_Localized: Rumble...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111726
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111727
    m_Localized: Hey, is everyone okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111728
    m_Localized: "Didn't seem like an explosion\u2014just a strong energy current."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111729
    m_Localized: She's not moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111730
    m_Localized: "Look closely\u2014her complexion's improved. Much better than before."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111731
    m_Localized: I strongly feel she was controlled by something, like me. But her
      case is far worse...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111732
    m_Localized: The purple energy in her chest is completely gone. Probably no fighting
      strength left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111733
    m_Localized: "Let's bring her back to Earth too\u2014not just to save her. We
      might learn more from her."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111734
    m_Localized: Everything happened so suddenly and strangely...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111735
    m_Localized: Sigh, guess we have no choice. I'll take care of her. You guys contact
      Satellite Cat to get back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111736
    m_Localized: Moneko, I'll leave the medical care to you. We beat her up pretty
      bad... hope she recovers soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111737
    m_Localized: Of course, handcuffs and safety measures are still needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111738
    m_Localized: Oh oh! Leave it to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111739
    m_Localized: We finally resolved a major issue. Everyone get some rest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111740
    m_Localized: I want rice balls and fried chicken! I'm exhausted! Sumo Cat and
      Pastry Cat are treating me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111741
    m_Localized: You just love free meals, don't you? Good thing you're fast, or
      you'd never make the roster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111742
    m_Localized: Enough chatter, let's go home!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111743
    m_Localized: What is this? Is this still Earth?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111744
    m_Localized: What happened to our home? Neither us cats nor enemies have seen
      anything like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111745
    m_Localized: At first glance... this looks like the future. So many new things
      we've never seen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111746
    m_Localized: She's someone we've never seen too, right? Her gear doesn't look
      from this era. Is she from the future?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111747
    m_Localized: Possible. That explains why she was randomly on the moon. We'll
      question her when she wakes up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111748
    m_Localized: But can one person change the world? That's too far-fetched.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111749
    m_Localized: Sigh, let's just go home... which way was it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111750
    m_Localized: ...???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111751
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111752
    m_Localized: Intruders spotted! Someone come quick!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111753
    m_Localized: Damn it, this is OUR home! How are WE the invaders?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111754
    m_Localized: Bro, we just got home and already gotta fight?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85402449783111755
    m_Localized: Find a place to settle Moneko and the others! Deal with the situation
      first!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576124002304
    m_Localized: ...Do you guys feel how windy it is around here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722560
    m_Localized: "I checked Doubao. The Philippines is in the northwest Pacific,
      called Typhoon Alley\u2014one of the most active tropical cyclone regions,
      over 20 per year, about 30% of global total..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722561
    m_Localized: Checked what? What's Doubao, some kind of bun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722562
    m_Localized: Wait, this doesn't seem like normal weather. The wind follows us
      everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722563
    m_Localized: Look over there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722564
    m_Localized: "Holy\u2014what's that? The vortex is alive, with eyes, flying toward
      us!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722565
    m_Localized: Is our future this chaotic? Can we even beat this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576182722566
    m_Localized: No, we need someone to stall it. Head-on is too reckless. Fight
      and retreat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305472
    m_Localized: Oh yeah! Exactly! If we can control the vortex without getting close,
      we can handle it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305473
    m_Localized: Guess future monsters aren't that scary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305474
    m_Localized: KK and Reisen are doing great against the red vortex! Seriously
      weakening it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305475
    m_Localized: But those blue alien enemies are annoying. Besides Leg Cat, no one's
      good against them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305476
    m_Localized: So my knockback doesn't count?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305477
    m_Localized: ...Anyway, we need to train more partners good against future enemies.
      Watch out for other vortex types too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305478
    m_Localized: "Didn't we call Satellite Cat when returning? He works in space,
      drove Mars rovers\u2014should know about future aliens. Let's bring him along."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305479
    m_Localized: Good, good. Managed to settle down in this lousy whirlwind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305480
    m_Localized: Oh no, where's our healer?! Off taking care of that moon boss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305481
    m_Localized: We're in this mess because of her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305482
    m_Localized: Sigh, bear with it. Once we figure her out, things should get better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305483
    m_Localized: It's not peaceful even now... hope so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305484
    m_Localized: Next we need to rest up and protect our cats' future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305485
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305486
    m_Localized: .........?????
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305487
    m_Localized: Whoa! Who are you now?! You scared me!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305488
    m_Localized: Defensive stance! Don't give an inch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305489
    m_Localized: ...What, you forgot me after a space trip? So the rumors about your
      amnesia are true, meow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305490
    m_Localized: We don't have amnesia! We remember fighting on the moon clearly,
      and we brought back the one who corrupted it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305491
    m_Localized: ...???
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305492
    m_Localized: You were on the moon with no contact for ages. We sent Satellite
      Cat to reach you, or you'd be space debris by now, meow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305493
    m_Localized: Huh? What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305494
    m_Localized: Alright... I heard that girl affected your minds. We're waiting
      for her to recover so we can find the truth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305495
    m_Localized: "Self-introduction once only, meow. I'm Miko, your current Chief
      Cat Resources strategist. Personnel, recruitment\u2014all my job. Finding you
      was my duty too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305496
    m_Localized: Forgetting someone this important is unforgivable. Hmph, we used
      to meet all the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305497
    m_Localized: Special circumstances this time. I'll let it slide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576195305498
    m_Localized: Really? Ugh. Everything feels so complicated now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499776
    m_Localized: KK, do you remember anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499777
    m_Localized: Nope, I've been with you guys the whole time. How would I know someone
      you don't?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499778
    m_Localized: ...? Could we really have amnesia?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499779
    m_Localized: ...Yeah.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499780
    m_Localized: How's the investigation? Nothing fishy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499781
    m_Localized: Asked many cat residents. Their descriptions of Miko are consistent,
      and her personality rating averages 8.7. Seems like a really famous figure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499782
    m_Localized: Also... almost everyone finds our amnesia strange because we've
      always been frontline commanders. They all know us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499783
    m_Localized: But after returning from the moon, everyone says we consistently
      forgot many things about the legion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499784
    m_Localized: And they're very confused about the strange girl we brought back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499785
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499786
    m_Localized: Actually, I found another problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499787
    m_Localized: If we all went to the moon, even with amnesia, we must have been
      on a mission. They didn't just randomly pick us up from the moon, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499788
    m_Localized: Sigh, I thought of that too. Here's the recording from my private
      chat with Miko.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499789
    m_Localized: '*Let me show you. This is your mission form before departure, code
      CL-3064.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499790
    m_Localized: '*Summary: CLPP-955 was developing sweetener fruit cultivation on
      the moon when unknown ruins and radio interference were discovered. Military
      special forces were dispatched for investigation.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499791
    m_Localized: "*The list follows\u2014it's you guys.*"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499792
    m_Localized: '*Mission dispatched successfully. Reports continued for 4 days,
      then 5 days of silence. Emergency contact with Satellite Cat for reinforcements.
      Reinforcement mission: CL-3066.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499793
    m_Localized: '*Later found large numbers with low vitals and unclear consciousness,
      emergency extraction. CL-3066 successful, CLPP-955 and CL-3064 failed. Re-mission
      pending.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499794
    m_Localized: After that, I investigated with military personnel. Similar results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499795
    m_Localized: Due to military secrecy, civilians couldn't mention our moon landing,
      but there were news reports about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499796
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499797
    m_Localized: So, what did we find in those 4 days?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499798
    m_Localized: I asked about that too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499799
    m_Localized: '*4-day investigation summary: The plantation area had significant
      radiation contamination. Biomass caused strong soil reactions. Unsuitable for
      cultivation. Further ruin investigation approved before deciding relocation.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499800
    m_Localized: Here are investigation photos. Internal use only, do not distribute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499801
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576199499802
    m_Localized: Any other leads? I'm completely lost. No memory of any of this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888384
    m_Localized: I have an unscientific theory. It's like our original brains inherited
      different cat bodies. We still recognize each other and use our original abilities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888385
    m_Localized: That's too sci-fi. How is that even possible?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888386
    m_Localized: ...Miko... the ruins... and the original moon incident... what is
      all this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888387
    m_Localized: Hi~ Moneko.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888388
    m_Localized: Oh, Miko! What's up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888389
    m_Localized: Did you sort out Alina? How is she now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888390
    m_Localized: She's recovering fast, but her physiology causes some incidents.
      Keeping her under observation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888391
    m_Localized: Thanks for your hard work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888392
    m_Localized: Also, her armor self-repairs. That might explain her tenacious vitality
      you mentioned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888393
    m_Localized: If we could research this tech, our cats' combat power would greatly
      increase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888394
    m_Localized: Yeah, looking forward to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888395
    m_Localized: "But Moneko, the frontline medical team needs your command too.
      Your legion's tactics differ from modern ones\u2014many medics find it hard
      to adapt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576207888396
    m_Localized: I'll have to trouble you again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082688
    m_Localized: Sigh, after all this, still working like a horse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082689
    m_Localized: Who called me just now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082690
    m_Localized: When will my star dream come true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082691
    m_Localized: Hehe, it's fine. I'll sing with you later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082692
    m_Localized: Hey Alina, time for your medicine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082693
    m_Localized: Ugh, so annoying! Your fever burned through several sheets even
      through your armor... The medical team is exhausted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082694
    m_Localized: Hmm... your temperature did drop. But you're still delirious...
      It's been ages since I had such a severe patient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082695
    m_Localized: Mmm......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082696
    m_Localized: Oh, finally awake. Drink your medicine yourself. Cause more trouble
      and I'm done with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082697
    m_Localized: Mmm... water... so hot, need cold drinks...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082698
    m_Localized: ......... I'm here to nurse you, not be your servant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082699
    m_Localized: Mmm... can't do it, you feed me... dying, dying...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082700
    m_Localized: ....................................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082701
    m_Localized: Hmm? What are you getting?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082702
    m_Localized: Patients like you need a good whack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082703
    m_Localized: Know your place!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082704
    m_Localized: Waaaaah!!! Sorry, I'm wrong, I'm wrong! I'll drink it now!! Calm
      down!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082705
    m_Localized: I can't stand you!!! This time I'm really doing it! I'll smash you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082706
    m_Localized: Nooooooo!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082707
    m_Localized: (*Thwack*)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082708
    m_Localized: Hehe, fooled you. Looks like a real hammer, but it's all foam. For
      scaring patients...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082709
    m_Localized: What if you scared the patient to death? The nurse is responsible!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082710
    m_Localized: Hmph, you said you could do it yourself before, quite nimble too.
      Now you're enjoying the service, huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082711
    m_Localized: I'm busy. After fixing you, I'm returning to the main force, or
      their wounded will be overwhelmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082712
    m_Localized: Actually, I'm quite reasonable. Not as scary or brutal as you think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082713
    m_Localized: Hearing your story in bed was surreal. Now I feel like I'm not even
      myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082714
    m_Localized: You haven't shaken your war criminal status. But Reisen insists
      you have your reasons and story, demanding we bring you back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082715
    m_Localized: Hmm... could this person be...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082716
    m_Localized: That would be me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082717
    m_Localized: "Let me take you for a walk. Get to know me and the cats\u2014it
      might help recover your memory."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082718
    m_Localized: But if you dare harm any cats now, I'll shoot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082719
    m_Localized: Hmm, Alina, you look much better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576212082720
    m_Localized: Your injuries were really scary. We didn't dare touch you for a
      long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576220471296
    m_Localized: Sigh, really thank you all. Without you, I'd be frozen solid on
      the moon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576220471297
    m_Localized: But as you guessed, I can't remember much. Maybe only through fragments...
      why I was on the moon, why I'm in your world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576220471298
    m_Localized: I think I should take you to the main force first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87690576220471299
    m_Localized: If you fight alongside them, they'll probably accept you. As for
      the past, explain slowly later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851200
    m_Localized: Seems your world isn't peaceful either. Even in this so-called "future,"
      conflicts continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851201
    m_Localized: Time to show my strength. Let's find the cats and regroup. I need
      to thank them for saving me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851202
    m_Localized: Yeah! I'll contact Miko right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851203
    m_Localized: Holy cow, what is this place? So chaotic!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851204
    m_Localized: Those vortexes again... Damn, surrounded by sandstorms! Hard to
      fight in this wasteland!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851205
    m_Localized: Let's tough it out! KK, Reisen! You control and stall them, we'll
      try to break them up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851206
    m_Localized: Roger!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851207
    m_Localized: Oh oh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851208
    m_Localized: '*Cough*... So hard! My spell got interrupted again! This feeling
      is awful!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851209
    m_Localized: But it's strange. We cleared the moon crisis, so why is future Earth
      even more chaotic...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851210
    m_Localized: Hey! Guys! Look who's here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851211
    m_Localized: Oh, it's Moneko! Come heal Baha... who's that behind you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851212
    m_Localized: My god, is my first battle this huge? What are those vortex things?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851213
    m_Localized: We wanted to ask YOU. Earth changed after we saved you. Thought
      you might be behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851214
    m_Localized: I have no idea. I'm even more confused. Never seen these things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851215
    m_Localized: Ah... wait, my core...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851216
    m_Localized: What now? You just recovered, don't do anything rash!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851217
    m_Localized: No... it's residual energy building up inside. It hurts... something's
      coming out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851218
    m_Localized: Get back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851219
    m_Localized: Don't do this! We're already in danger! Another explosion and we're
      done for!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851220
    m_Localized: AAAAAAAH!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851221
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851222
    m_Localized: Great, we're done. Vortexes ahead, that thing behind. Game over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851223
    m_Localized: "...Wait, no. Different from her energy buildup before. I feel heat
      waves\u2014she's releasing powerful energy!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851224
    m_Localized: Ooooooh!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851225
    m_Localized: What's happening! My muscles are gonna burst! Can't stop! Oooooh!!
      Kill kill kill!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851226
    m_Localized: "Holy\u2014I'm doing 100m in 5 seconds, one-shotting rhinos!!! I'm
      gonna take off!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851227
    m_Localized: Ehehe... Muscle Mouse... where are you... I can't hold it... ehehe...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851228
    m_Localized: Wait Moneko, what are you doing! Let me take you aside to calm down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851229
    m_Localized: Wow... haven't been this energetic in ages. Let's take this chance
      to go all out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851230
    m_Localized: What is this power... truly not to be underestimated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851231
    m_Localized: Hurry up, dawdling isn't like you guys at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851232
    m_Localized: Hey, who are we looking for? This is so sudden!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851233
    m_Localized: Oh meow! You forgot her? She's your crucial training mentor! You'll
      need her to get stronger!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851234
    m_Localized: (Whispering) What exactly happened since we came to the future...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851235
    m_Localized: Alright, we're here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305772851236
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045504
    m_Localized: ......Hmm... you mean she'll help our cats break through and get
      stronger?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045505
    m_Localized: That's right, meow! Gather materials as she requests, then come
      back in a couple days for inspection!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045506
    m_Localized: "Yes. Cynthia\u2014you can call me Cin."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045507
    m_Localized: I'm an alchemist, but my stamina is terrible. I really don't want
      to go gather herbs, so I'll trouble you cats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045508
    m_Localized: Where do we find these herbs?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045509
    m_Localized: Hmm... by the nearby lakeshore, and further in the small forest...
      Hmm... just follow my drawings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045510
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045511
    m_Localized: Wait, isn't there too much to complain about here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045512
    m_Localized: Why do we have to do this when it's right next to your house?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045513
    m_Localized: And why is there such medieval alchemy in this era? Is this even
      reliable?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045514
    m_Localized: ...Just a personal hobby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045515
    m_Localized: I'm weak, so you'd have to protect me if I went out. Besides, YOU
      cats need the upgrades. I don't really need these cat's eyes and potions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045516
    m_Localized: ...You do have a point.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045517
    m_Localized: Hey, don't play the weak maiden card. As our cats' veteran trainer,
      we all know what you're capable of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045518
    m_Localized: Hehe... didn't you say they have amnesia? Just messing with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045519
    m_Localized: "But be careful\u2014I've set up magic circles in this forest. Best
      to explore quickly and return within a day, or you might get lost."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045520
    m_Localized: Isn't this obviously a trap for us?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045521
    m_Localized: Well, as long as the kids work hard, I'll teach them proper leveling
      techniques.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87693305777045522
    m_Localized: Hey meow! Thanks in advance!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186262167552
    m_Localized: Hmm... looks like most of these vortexes are gone. There shouldn't
      be this many from now on, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082112
    m_Localized: Uwaa! What did we just do?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082113
    m_Localized: We just went berserk. I felt a power like never before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082114
    m_Localized: Hehe, you guys owe me one this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082115
    m_Localized: Your power is terrifying. We still need to lock you up and study
      you some more...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082116
    m_Localized: Hey hey, that's not fair!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082117
    m_Localized: Actually, I've always had a question.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082118
    m_Localized: Even when Moneko was treating you, we never saw you take off that
      armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082119
    m_Localized: And when you recovered, your armor and core recovered with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082120
    m_Localized: Is this armor actually part of your body?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082121
    m_Localized: Yeah, why is that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082122
    m_Localized: Hmm... indeed. In my memory, I adapted to this new body a long time
      ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082123
    m_Localized: But as for this 'dark frenzy' you mentioned, I really have no memory
      of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082124
    m_Localized: This core is also the source of my life. As long as it's on me,
      I won't die.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082125
    m_Localized: "I only released that energy in an emergency\u2014I couldn't just
      watch cats die, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082126
    m_Localized: (Even though you only unleashed it when fighting us.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082127
    m_Localized: Alright, since the storm is dealt with, let's head back slowly.
      We'll have plenty to ask you later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082128
    m_Localized: Since you all saved me, I'll do as you say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082129
    m_Localized: That said, besides me, one of your own has a core too. Why are you
      so curious about me, the newcomer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082130
    m_Localized: The one with rabbit ears.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082131
    m_Localized: Hmm? Are you talking about me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082132
    m_Localized: Exactly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082133
    m_Localized: The center of that disc on your back has the same properties as
      the core on my chest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082134
    m_Localized: "However... yours is external. It won't directly affect your life.
      Mine is internal\u2014without it, I'm done for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082135
    m_Localized: I suspect someone turned you into a puppet. It must've been hard
      to break free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186325082136
    m_Localized: Yes, indeed. I have these cats to thank for helping me find myself
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276416
    m_Localized: Besides, you were able to control her. Back on the moon, Reisen
      blacked out again when she was with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276417
    m_Localized: Hmm... seems yours is quite serious too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276418
    m_Localized: I'll have to study you later... hehe...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276419
    m_Localized: ...?? What are you going to do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276420
    m_Localized: You've crossed the line! We haven't even interrogated you, and you're
      already studying us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276421
    m_Localized: Hmm... do you feel something strange?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276422
    m_Localized: '*Sniff sniff*... I don''t think so. What kind of aura?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276423
    m_Localized: A sort of... aura similar to yours?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276424
    m_Localized: And it's pretty strong, with a hint of wild, primal ferocity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276425
    m_Localized: What kind of description is that? I don't get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276426
    m_Localized: I'm not even in heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276427
    m_Localized: I'm a top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186329276428
    m_Localized: Lemme see! (Jie Ge voice)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470720
    m_Localized: (*pat pat*)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470721
    m_Localized: Hmm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470722
    m_Localized: What's going on? This texture feels wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470723
    m_Localized: Titan Cat, what are you doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470724
    m_Localized: Hmm? Eh? Wasn't I petting a kitten?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470725
    m_Localized: Then what was I touching......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470726
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470727
    m_Localized: ROOOOAARRR!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470728
    m_Localized: AAAAAAH!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288782
    m_Localized: After all, they look like our own kind, so it feels hard to strike...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288781
    m_Localized: Everyone should split into groups and clean up the mutations in
      each area. They feel much more troublesome than the original enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288780
    m_Localized: We... still have much to explore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288779
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288778
    m_Localized: If you have memories from another timeline, then what happens to
      the you in that other timeline? Does your consciousness just cut out? That
      clearly doesn't make sense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288777
    m_Localized: But before and after the moon incident, your bodies never changed.
      Everyone remembers you. It's impossible you were switched with someone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288776
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288775
    m_Localized: Miko, I don't think we're really amnesiac. We still retain memories
      from another timeline...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288774
    m_Localized: Maybe... it's also related to your amnesia from the moon...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288773
    m_Localized: There have always been reports from the western hemisphere about
      seeing "mutated" cats wandering around and attacking other cats. After the
      previous storm incident ended, it seems to have truly gotten more serious now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288772
    m_Localized: Hmm... if you've lost your previous memories, then indeed you wouldn't
      remember these things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288771
    m_Localized: What civil war? I had no idea there were cats emitting black smoke!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288770
    m_Localized: Wow, seems like your civil war is pretty serious too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288769
    m_Localized: Is this about looking cool?! You guys just fought another me! There's
      a darkened version of me out there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671648288768
    m_Localized: I gotta say, it looks pretty badass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115499671556014080
    m_Localized: Holy crap, what the hell? How is there a dark form of me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470764
    m_Localized: Hey guys!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470765
    m_Localized: Look, I actually found my brother in Europe! We're totally kindred
      spirits!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470766
    m_Localized: What? Who's your brother? Why are you suddenly finding relatives
      in a foreign land?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470767
    m_Localized: Weren't you all amnesiac? Where'd you find a brother?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470768
    m_Localized: Hmph, don't believe me? I already brought him here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470769
    m_Localized: Ta-da!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470770
    m_Localized: Hmph, I'm telling you, he looks almost exactly like I used to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470771
    m_Localized: Look at this axe! It's exactly like the ones our axe gang used!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470772
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470773
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470774
    m_Localized: I say... why don't you take a closer look at his face?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470775
    m_Localized: Face? What's with the face? He's got scars on his eyes, armor, and
      black smoke on his head...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470776
    m_Localized: ....................
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470777
    m_Localized: ROOOOAARRR!!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470778
    m_Localized: AAAAAAH!!! Get away!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470779
    m_Localized: Wow! If you're gonna disguise yourself that badly, don't bother
      dressing up at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470780
    m_Localized: Look at you trying to copy me! You don't look like me at all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470781
    m_Localized: Your look is totally outdated! It's all about lions now! Lions are
      way stronger than cows!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470782
    m_Localized: What, you wanna ram me?! You little brat, you want a piece of me?
      Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470783
    m_Localized: (Fighting...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470784
    m_Localized: (*Rumble rumble*)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470785
    m_Localized: Holy crap... Big bro, I was wrong...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470786
    m_Localized: Hmm... The aura on them feels strangely familiar...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470787
    m_Localized: Connected to you again? Looks like we need to interrogate you harder!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470788
    m_Localized: You mean it's similar to your core's energy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470789
    m_Localized: Not really. It's quite different. Not like me and Reisen. We were
      being controlled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470790
    m_Localized: "Them being uncontrolled, radiating energy freely\u2014they must
      be infected by another form."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470791
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470792
    m_Localized: I can't help but find you suspicious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470793
    m_Localized: How do you know all this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470794
    m_Localized: You really are suspicious. You seem to know everything about this
      world's changes, even though you never had contact with cats before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470795
    m_Localized: Hmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186333470796
    m_Localized: Listen, I do have some memories of my past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665024
    m_Localized: Things about myself, my past, and where I need to go in the future.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665025
    m_Localized: You once said you'd protect something with your life, but the moon
      is desolate. What is there to protect?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665026
    m_Localized: Hmm... true, but what I protect isn't the moon. It should be someone
      else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665027
    m_Localized: Because I have no memory of going to the moon at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665028
    m_Localized: Then what do you remember?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665029
    m_Localized: Yes, that's what I wanted to say. I only remember being controlled...
      My comrades and I were controlled by our organization, and we resolved to rebel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665030
    m_Localized: We thought this core was a military reward for greater combat power,
      but we were actually just test subjects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665031
    m_Localized: At first, we truly believed we had gained new abilities and were
      loyal to the organization.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665032
    m_Localized: But gradually, we lost control of our bodies. Energy began flowing
      back into the core, unleashing destructive power unintentionally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665033
    m_Localized: We were quickly isolated and used for experiments by the military
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665034
    m_Localized: As for them, they had been separated from me long before I lost
      consciousness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665035
    m_Localized: Their names... ugh... I can't remember...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665036
    m_Localized: And what I was protecting... can't remember... damn it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665037
    m_Localized: As you saw, I can easily unleash destructive power. And now that
      you've healed me, I can share that power with you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665038
    m_Localized: I have a feeling you'll take me where I need to go. Hmm... just
      a hunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665039
    m_Localized: We're just using each other, that's all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665040
    m_Localized: So you want to use us to find your lost friends and what you claim
      to protect, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665041
    m_Localized: Since we're partners, I'll tell you everything I know. No need to
      interrogate me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665042
    m_Localized: Reisen, do you still have memories from before? How did you get
      to the moon?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665043
    m_Localized: I can't remember at all... I just felt I had no choice but to follow
      the cats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665044
    m_Localized: You're also an important clue. Because of you, the cats and I seem
      to be from three different timelines. We know nothing about each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665045
    m_Localized: Even you and the cats who saved me seem to have amnesia, completely
      different from what Miko described.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665046
    m_Localized: That is true... We can't explain that for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665047
    m_Localized: Since it's come to this, we just have to do our best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665048
    m_Localized: Hey, I say, enough is enough... How long is this farce going to
      continue?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665049
    m_Localized: First of all, we haven't provoked any cats. We're just seeking our
      own living space. Why must we constantly be disturbed by you cats?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665050
    m_Localized: The invaders dare to talk back! Never even seen you before and you're
      this aggressive! Seems like you need another beating!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665051
    m_Localized: I advise you to be kind. If our people fight you with our lives,
      you'll never have peace again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665052
    m_Localized: Besides, this was originally our territory. If not for the cat invasion,
      we'd never be wandering like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665053
    m_Localized: Damn it. No matter what form you take now, even if you kill me,
      our people will always be enemies of cats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665054
    m_Localized: Ha, let's see if you still dare talk like that after eating my fist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665055
    m_Localized: Hmph, I'll take you on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665065
    m_Localized: You still think you're righteous? Let me tell you, you're narrowing
      your path. You'll only make more enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665066
    m_Localized: You brat, you're really hard to kill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665067
    m_Localized: We are endless... Your recklessness and ignorance will make you
      pay an ever-heavier price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186337665068
    m_Localized: Who are you people? Why do you hold such deep hatred for cats?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859328
    m_Localized: ...You... You don't look like you're with the cats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859329
    m_Localized: They saved my life, so I owe them. For now, I hope to cooperate
      with them properly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859330
    m_Localized: ...Save people?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859331
    m_Localized: ...Are you telling the truth?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859332
    m_Localized: It's true. They once helped me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859333
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859334
    m_Localized: We'll leave this place for now. Come with me. I'll see that you
      suffer less harm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859335
    m_Localized: What's the meaning of this?! Can't win so you're trying to go soft?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859336
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859337
    m_Localized: We've seen two kinds of cat forces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859338
    m_Localized: "One is what you see\u2014these rampaging cats. Though violent and
      lawless, they have no real will of their own. To us, they're like tameable
      beasts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859339
    m_Localized: "The other is cats like you. Seemingly reasonable, but actually
      organized, scheming, calculating\u2014the cats who destroyed our home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859340
    m_Localized: Fighting you, we sensed you're somewhat different from the latter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859341
    m_Localized: How so?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859342
    m_Localized: ...Well... you're a bit dumber than them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859343
    m_Localized: Looks like you still need a beating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859344
    m_Localized: You still don't get the situation. You'd better talk to your superiors
      and figure out what kind of scum you really are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859345
    m_Localized: I'm leaving now. I'll leave some scrapped robots for you to play
      with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859346
    m_Localized: 'I''ll say it again: I advise you to be kind.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859347
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859348
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859349
    m_Localized: Do you... truly know yourselves...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859350
    m_Localized: .........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859351
    m_Localized: Moneko?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859352
    m_Localized: Hmm? What's up?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859353
    m_Localized: (Narrates the encounter with the refugee...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859354
    m_Localized: Hmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859355
    m_Localized: I don't really get it...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859356
    m_Localized: I always tell myself not to get confused by all this mess, just
      focus on the present. Besides, Miko doesn't seem to believe in crossing timelines
      either.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859357
    m_Localized: Hard as it is to believe, the cats here all say so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859358
    m_Localized: We don't know how to return to our original world anyway. Doing
      logistics with Miko here isn't so different from our old work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859359
    m_Localized: But I do have things I like and want to work hard at now. Lately...
      I've been a bit busy, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859360
    m_Localized: Hmm... Will we find the ultimate answer someday?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859361
    m_Localized: Hey, why are you helping these crazed cats? What's it to you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859362
    m_Localized: Huh? Didn't I tell you? Crazed cats make loyal pets and war machines.
      Attack them, and our people will attack you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859363
    m_Localized: You lot still have no brains. Can't even manage your own kind, need
      cross-species coordination to help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859364
    m_Localized: You... watch your mouth...!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859365
    m_Localized: It's all facts. Harsh words are normal for idiots like you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859366
    m_Localized: Right now, if you lay a finger on me, the guerrilla refugees will
      come for you anytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859367
    m_Localized: ......Hmph! (*slams ground*)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859368
    m_Localized: ...As for you humans... I can't say. Looks like you all have your
      own goals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859369
    m_Localized: Well... at least we don't mean each other harm right now, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859370
    m_Localized: No objection. Less fighting is always good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859371
    m_Localized: Yes. I'm just a traveller from another world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859372
    m_Localized: Another world traveller...? Cats, you believe that? Why would she
      follow you if she had no agenda?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859373
    m_Localized: ...??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859374
    m_Localized: Yes, she's our ally and a good partner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859375
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859376
    m_Localized: Hmph.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859377
    m_Localized: ...What's that supposed to mean? So annoying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859378
    m_Localized: By the way, where are you taking us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859379
    m_Localized: We can pass through your roaming area relatively safely, but there
      must be a destination, right? Don't try any tricks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859380
    m_Localized: ...Hmph. Do you know how much talking it took to give you the green
      light all the way? I haven't complained yet, so be grateful, brats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186341859381
    m_Localized: This is a western checkpoint. Once you pass it, I'll let you go.
      There's nothing beyond that we want to reach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053632
    m_Localized: Is this basically exile...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053633
    m_Localized: Wow~ exile? No way. There may not be anywhere for us to go, but
      there's somewhere for YOU to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053634
    m_Localized: Didn't you say you wanted to find the truth about your identities?
      That's probably up ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053635
    m_Localized: What kind of place is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053636
    m_Localized: Who knows, I don't care. But I'll tell you, there's a core like
      yours there, and energy fluctuations. Many of our brothers died there. None
      of us dare go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053637
    m_Localized: Alright, hurry up and go. I'm exhausted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053638
    m_Localized: Also, passing our checkpoint doesn't mean there aren't our people
      outside. Don't let your guard down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053639
    m_Localized: You lot are such a pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053640
    m_Localized: Then let's inform Miko and go check it out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053641
    m_Localized: This journey has been so hard, I just want to go back to sleep...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053642
    m_Localized: Since we have a goal, let's hang in there a bit longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053643
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053644
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053645
    m_Localized: Bros, tail them, cut their comms, and watch them go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053646
    m_Localized: Tell the brothers along the way that someone's investigating that
      hellhole. Let them through without much fuss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053647
    m_Localized: Told you you're stupid. Ahead is a forbidden zone, and the energy
      source is in the sea. With zero intel on this energy, you're walking to your
      deaths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053648
    m_Localized: Don't care what cat faction you're from. None of my business. Honestly,
      wiping you all out would be better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053649
    m_Localized: Just try come back alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053650
    m_Localized: I'm serious. I really, really hate these people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053651
    m_Localized: Why can't we get some guns? This fight is totally unfair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053652
    m_Localized: Doesn't the cowboy cat have a gun?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053653
    m_Localized: His? That's just a toy. Lucky if it shoots a few meters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053654
    m_Localized: "We need what they use\u2014big, thick, fast-shooting ones."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053655
    m_Localized: (Ponders thoughtfully)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053656
    m_Localized: But compared to those humans, aren't you guys also cheating?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053657
    m_Localized: You can go to the sky and underground, plus my super strength. I
      think they're pretty strong for not complaining.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053658
    m_Localized: ...That said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053659
    m_Localized: Yeah, speaking of super strength. Actually I remember my strength
      wasn't the greatest back then... One of my comrades, she seemed to have a power
      to manipulate objects at will... I don't really remember the details, but I
      think my body remembers being attacked by her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053660
    m_Localized: You mean like the Force from Star Wars?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053661
    m_Localized: Star Wars?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053662
    m_Localized: Simply put, it's the power to control the state of objects at will,
      making everything around you a weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053663
    m_Localized: Hmm... Probably not that exaggerated. But being able to control
      objects does feel a bit like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053664
    m_Localized: Not bad, you helped me recover some memories. Though just fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053665
    m_Localized: Hehe, thank me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053666
    m_Localized: Maybe we should tell each other more stories. Maybe we'll both remember
      things from the past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053667
    m_Localized: Whew... So we've encountered all our crazed dark forms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186346053668
    m_Localized: "Hard to communicate with, but just like that wandering refugee
      said\u2014as long as you give them enough benefits (food and drink), they're
      easy to keep and strong in combat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247936
    m_Localized: Don't you feel like you're raising pets? Kid, your thinking is dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247937
    m_Localized: Maybe we can turn them back later. If they can blacken, they can
      be whitewashed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247938
    m_Localized: True. We need to protect them properly now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247939
    m_Localized: Isn't that just raising pets?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247940
    m_Localized: ..........
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247941
    m_Localized: "I can't even argue... Whatever, it doesn't matter. Final stage\u2014Titan
      Cat, your dark form!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247942
    m_Localized: Ha, bring it on! Time to teach my dark self a lesson!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247943
    m_Localized: As expected, the energy source is in the sea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247944
    m_Localized: Can you guys do it, go underwater? I remember cats being afraid
      of water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247945
    m_Localized: You needn't worry about that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247946
    m_Localized: We have Swimmer Cat, Drift Fisher, Golden Axe Silver Axe Cat, even
      Satellite Cat is waterproof. Cats have long since learned to handle water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247947
    m_Localized: Aha...? That strong?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247948
    m_Localized: Alright then, let's go down together and see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247949
    m_Localized: Woohoo, long-range comms seem restored. Let's report to Miko. We
      might have a huge breakthrough soon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247950
    m_Localized: Nice, everything's heading in a good direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247951
    m_Localized: This is... a ruined laboratory?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247952
    m_Localized: Why another lab? I'm getting PTSD. Seeing places like this makes
      me think Alina's gonna black out again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247953
    m_Localized: Your intuition is spot on. I can feel a long-lost aura here. Maybe
      we can find the source of our energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247954
    m_Localized: Let's hurry forward and see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247955
    m_Localized: ...Static... ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247956
    m_Localized: Hello, hello... Hey, can anyone hear me over there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247957
    m_Localized: We're here. We seem to have found some important clues, we're about
      to...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247958
    m_Localized: You! What are you doing there! Come back! That's an order!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247959
    m_Localized: Huh? Miko? But...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247960
    m_Localized: No buts! Before we're fully prepared, you are not to enter such
      dangerous places!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247961
    m_Localized: I'm sending someone to retrieve you immediately! You lot will all
      be punished when you get back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247962
    m_Localized: Ehh??!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247963
    m_Localized: Hmm... since we're getting punished anyway... we're already here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247964
    m_Localized: What?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247965
    m_Localized: Wait, stop arguing, I hear something over there...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247966
    m_Localized: There's a blue light... Someone's here! Watch out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247967
    m_Localized: Aaah!!! You people really... You've gotten me into trouble!! You
      guys... Hey! What are you waiting for, you lot! And Time Machine Cat, Satellite
      Cat, hurry up and go save them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247968
    m_Localized: Look at that blue light, it's flashing fast, it's coming! Everyone
      be careful, fall back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247969
    m_Localized: That thing's charging! No time to retreat! Prepare for battle!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247970
    m_Localized: Let's see what the hell is here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247971
    m_Localized: As night fell, Moneko stared at her empty wallet and sank into deep
      self-doubt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247972
    m_Localized: Sigh... if I don't make some cash this month, I won't even make
      rent. Am I really not cute enough?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247973
    m_Localized: She recalled the taunts from her archrival, Nonoka the Doggie, earlier
      that day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247974
    m_Localized: "(Rolls her eyes) Granny, chill. You've got zero fans over there.
      I'm a huge star now \u2014 one video gets 100k likes, nya-nya~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247975
    m_Localized: (Clenching her fist) Ugh, that smug face... Sigh, tonight I'll just
      grab some discount oden at 8-22. Maybe if I act cute... nah, I'm not gonna
      humiliate myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247976
    m_Localized: Meanwhile, on the other side...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247977
    m_Localized: So annoying! I'm out of cola and my phone's empty... But I remember
      getting New Year's money last year, lemme dig around...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247978
    m_Localized: Found it! A whole 200 bucks! Time to invade the convenience store!
      Mwahahaha, I'm the Cola Overlord!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247979
    m_Localized: Hmm, but first, a vital mission...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247980
    m_Localized: Nerd Cat carefully peeled back a corner of his ridiculously heavy
      four-layer blackout curtain, confirmed zero sunlight, then stealthily slipped
      on his jacket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186350247981
    m_Localized: Yes, the time is right! The Cola Overlord marches forth!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442240
    m_Localized: Just as Nerd Cat charged up to the 8-22 entrance, he crashed head-on
      into Moneko.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442241
    m_Localized: OW!! What the heck! That hurt, you know! Eat my Waist-Shattering
      Punch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442242
    m_Localized: Still fuming, Moneko put all her strength into a blow that slammed
      Nerd Cat into a concrete pillar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442243
    m_Localized: (After a full five minutes) Ow... I think my ribs are busted...
      Didn't your mom teach you to say sorry when you bump into someone?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442244
    m_Localized: Holy crap, I'm that strong?! D-dude, you look all frail. I'll take
      you back to my place to recover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442245
    m_Localized: (Eyes gleaming shrewdly) Deal! No take-backs! But first, you gotta
      buy me a big bottle of cola!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442246
    m_Localized: Once they got to Moneko's place, Nerd Cat was completely blown away
      by the walls plastered with posters and rooms full of merchandise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442247
    m_Localized: Whoa... so many posters, and they're all of you. Are you an idol?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442248
    m_Localized: (Sniffling) I guess so, but my popularity's tanked. I've tried everything
      to get more buzz, but I just can't blow up. I'm not good at acting cute like
      other idols.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442249
    m_Localized: (Patting her back, trying to sound mature) Hey now, I'm actually
      a pretty solid talent manager. I've played a ton of idol-raising sims! As long
      as you keep me supplied with cola, I guarantee you'll go viral!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442250
    m_Localized: Really?! So what do I do to get famous?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442251
    m_Localized: First, you need a stage name with star power. What style are you
      after?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442252
    m_Localized: Hmm... ethereal, youthfully cute, pure yet smart, with repeated
      syllables, and it has to sound like a top influencer right away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442253
    m_Localized: That's way too many demands! Ugh... got it! For ethereal, "Yuzuru"
      is perfect. Add a cute twist on your own name and... "Yuzuru Momoka", how's
      that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442254
    m_Localized: (Starry-eyed) Wow, "Yuzuru Momoka"! That name totally fits me! This
      fairy is debuting all over again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442255
    m_Localized: But how did you come up with that name?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442256
    m_Localized: "Haha... when in doubt, borrow a little. Mom always said that. For
      \"Yuzuru\", it's from that figure skating star Yuzuru \u25A0..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442257
    m_Localized: Ah, but I don't like plagiarism... (Looks down)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442258
    m_Localized: "(Panicking) Hey hey Momoka! It's not plagiarism \u2014 there's
      a difference between borrowing and stealing. We're not costing that star anything..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442259
    m_Localized: Fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442260
    m_Localized: "So, to celebrate my new stage name \u2014 there's a little event
      tomorrow night, and I did my makeup special for it. (Says mysteriously)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442261
    m_Localized: Huh? What event? (Swallows) A celebration feast...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442262
    m_Localized: Forget the feast, tomorrow night is ten times more fun~ (Winks)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442263
    m_Localized: Ew... fine, what's the event?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442264
    m_Localized: Heh heh... don't you wanna be chased by crowds? Don't you wanna
      be a mega-celebrity everyone's eyes are on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442265
    m_Localized: ...Not even a little bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442266
    m_Localized: What did you say? (Instantly dark-faced)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442267
    m_Localized: Aah! (Terrified) I didn't say anything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442268
    m_Localized: Yuzuru Momoka pulled out her phone, then when he wasn't looking,
      snatched off Nerd Cat's glasses. *Snap* went the photo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442269
    m_Localized: "Son of a\u2014! (Eyes stung, tears streaming, hands covering his
      eyes) That freaking hurts! What are you doing?!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442270
    m_Localized: Oops, my bad... haha. Anyway, there's a beauty contest on the Kongsu
      Bar, and I entered you too. Think of it as thanks~
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442271
    m_Localized: The next day...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442272
    m_Localized: Sir, please vote for "Yuzuru Momoka" on Kongsu Bar, and I'll give
      you a carton of eggs...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442273
    m_Localized: By afternoon, Momoka was dead on her feet when she ran right into
      her rival Nonoka the Doggie.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442274
    m_Localized: Well, well, granny. A washed-up micro-celebrity begging for votes
      on the street? Too bad, even a fancy name can't beat a natural beauty like
      me. Just wait to get stomped. (Shoves her deliberately)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442275
    m_Localized: Yuzuru Momoka fell to the ground and burst into messy tears. Late
      that night, she stood on the rooftop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442276
    m_Localized: I have to fight, I have to win! I'll make Nonoka the Doggie utterly
      defeated beneath me! Don't think you can arrogantly have the last laugh!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442277
    m_Localized: The Kongsu Bar beauty contest finally ended, and Yuzuru Momoka specially
      called Nerd Cat over to watch the results together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442278
    m_Localized: This time, I will definitely win... Stop sleeping! You're not a
      baby, what's with the plushie? (Flicks Nerd Cat on the forehead while he's
      half-asleep and snatches the baku plushie from his arms)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442279
    m_Localized: Oww! You violent woman... (Muttering)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442280
    m_Localized: Alright, everyone. We'll announce from tenth place...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442281
    m_Localized: With every name called, Yuzuru Momoka grew more and more tense,
      afraid she'd miss her own. But even by second place, neither of those two names
      had been heard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442282
    m_Localized: "And the first-place winner of this beauty contest is \u2014 Nerd
      Cat!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442283
    m_Localized: (In unison) WHAAAT?!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442284
    m_Localized: "Here's the explanation. Nowadays, everyone tries to craft a \"glamorous
      beauty\" look \u2014 pretty, but unnatural."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442285
    m_Localized: The first-place Nerd Cat, with those adorable teary eyes in his
      photo, creates the ultimate "fragile vibe" that just makes you want to shower
      him with affection! He looks so pitiful it's insanely cute!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186354442286
    m_Localized: Clearly a cute-style boy, that flustered little expression is way
      too kawaii... moe overload!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186358636544
    m_Localized: Staring at the screen, Yuzuru Momoka and Nonoka the Doggie were
      so furious they spurted nosebleeds like fountains and collapsed in their respective
      rooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186358636545
    m_Localized: Uh... you okay, sis? Don't blame me... I'm outta here! Sayonara!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115266186358636546
    m_Localized: Still, I don't get what's so great about beauty contests. Whether
      you're prettier or uglier than someone else isn't a reason to feel superior...
      whatever, forget it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
